WEBVTT

47:24.125 --> 47:25.209
If only she were alive.

47:27.250 --> 47:29.667
Don't shush me.
Your aunt helped us a great deal.

47:29.875 --> 47:31.584
We need to have some gratitude.

47:32.459 --> 47:35.250
We changed our real names
for fear of alerting your father.

47:35.334 --> 47:37.167
We dug our own graves in a way.
